{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Laravel 12 Middleware Management",
  "description": "Middleware creation and registration workflow for Laravel 12",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileCreated",
    "patterns": ["app/Http/Middleware/*.php"]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Middleware has been created. Please guide through Laravel 12 middleware management:\n\n1. **Registration**: Register in bootstrap/app.php using withMiddleware() method\n2. **Type Hints**: Use proper type hints in handle() method\n3. **Error Handling**: Implement proper error handling and validation\n4. **Middleware Groups**: Add middleware to appropriate groups (web, api, etc.)\n5. **Aliases**: Configure middleware aliases for easier usage\n6. **Testing**: Create tests for middleware functionality\n7. **Performance**: Consider performance impact and caching\n8. **Documentation**: Add proper documentation and examples\n\nRun `php artisan route:list --middleware` to verify middleware assignment."
  }
}